cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "caduceus"
abstract: >-
  A multi-seat decision engine on Hermes Agent. The operator sets vision, goals and
  final calls; the seats are staff, cast to compensate the operator's measured gaps and
  spread across four model families on purpose, because same-family agents agree too
  easily. It configures Hermes' existing profiles, dispatcher, cron, gateways and hooks
  rather than reinventing them.
